# Planted bugs in the hand-written reference, not in the Dafny-proved core.
# Each one must make the differential test fail, which confirms the test
# would have caught the same disagreement if the bug had been in the core
# instead.
run python -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider test_differential.py
properties test_dafny_matches_reference
file reference.py

mutation the leftover cents go to one index too many
detects test_dafny_matches_reference
-     return [share + 1 if i < leftover else share for i in range(n)]
+     return [share + 1 if i <= leftover else share for i in range(n)]

mutation the leftover cents go to the last recipients instead of the first
detects test_dafny_matches_reference
-     return [share + 1 if i < leftover else share for i in range(n)]
+     return [share + 1 if i >= n - leftover else share for i in range(n)]

harmless the docstring is reworded
- """Split total evenly across n recipients. The first `total % n` recipients get one extra."""
+ """Split total evenly, largest remainders first."""
